        <mxCell id="n3-s4-fin" parent="n3-c-periodo" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;align=center;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Courier New&quot;&gt;_finalizar&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;prox_acao&lt;/b&gt; = Assinar memo à APIS (período dos dependentes) e encaminhar&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;_registrar_numeros_memos: relê a árvore e preenche &amp;lt;memo&amp;gt;_sei (falha só gera log)&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
